<title>USA: GTE Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>GTE Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.69		    $0.63</p>
<p> Net			665,000		  616,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,281,000		4,951,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 960,000		  975,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call consensus for the 1997 first quarter was $0.68 per share. 1996 results include a gain related to the sale of certain domestic local-exchange operations of that boosted net income by $8 million or $0.01 per share.</p>
</text>
